Class CatalogToolset:
- expose bounded read-only catalog helpers for champions, items, runes, batch lookups, and search
- route all slug lookups through the in-memory catalog snapshot
- return documented ToolView payloads instead of raw catalog payloads
- rank fuzzy name matches with a blended `fuzzywuzzy` score so near-miss IDs like `wr-ludens-echo` still land on the real catalog slug
- return explicit `id` fields, top-match detail, and category-based item-ID listings so the main model can see the real catalog identifiers directly
- keep batch/search helpers capped and stable so model-visible tool usage stays bounded
- keep tool behavior deterministic and side-effect free
